        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n4\n1 1 3 3\n3\n2 2 2\n9\n1 2 1 2 3 2 3 4 4",
        "output": "4\n2\n6",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : The entire array is good.\nTest Case 2 : A subsequence [2,2][2, 2][2,2] of length 222 is good."
      }
    ]
